"Dasakanipāta ", "ja454:0.3": "Catudvāravagga ", "ja454:0.4": "16. Ghaṭapaṇḍitajātaka ", "ja454:1.1": "“Uṭṭhehi kaṇha kiṁ sesi, ", "ja454:1.2": "Ko attho supanena te; ", "ja454:1.3": "Yopi tuyhaṁ sako bhātā, ", "ja454:1.4": "Hadayaṁ cakkhu ca dakkhiṇaṁ; ", "ja454:1.5": "Tassa vātā balīyanti, ", "ja454:1.6": "Ghaṭo jappati kesava”. ", "ja454:2.1": "“Tassa taṁ vacanaṁ sutvā, ", "ja454:2.2": "rohiṇeyyassa kesavo; ", "ja454:2.3": "Taramānarūpo vuṭṭhāsi, ", "ja454:2.4": "bhātusokena aṭṭito”. ", "ja454:3.1": "“Kiṁ nu ummattarūpova, ", "ja454:3.2": "kevalaṁ dvārakaṁ imaṁ; ", "ja454:3.3": "Saso sasoti lapasi, ", "ja454:3.4": "ko nu te sasamāhari”. ", "ja454:4.1": "“Sovaṇṇamayaṁ maṇīmayaṁ, ", "ja454:4.2": "Lohamayaṁ atha rūpiyāmayaṁ; ", "ja454:4.3": "Saṅkhasilāpavāḷamayaṁ, ", "ja454:4.4": "Kārayissāmi te sasaṁ”. ", "ja454:5.1": "“Santi aññepi sasakā, ", "ja454:5.2": "araññe vanagocarā; ", "ja454:5.3": "Tepi te ānayissāmi, ", "ja454:5.4": "kīdisaṁ sasamicchasi”. ", "ja454:6.1": "“Na cāhamete icchāmi, ", "ja454:6.2": "ye sasā pathavissitā; ", "ja454:6.3": "Candato sasamicchāmi, ", "ja454:6.4": "taṁ me ohara kesava”. ", "ja454:7.1": "“So nūna madhuraṁ ñāti, ", "ja454:7.2": "jīvitaṁ vijahissasi; ", "ja454:7.3": "Apatthiyaṁ yo patthayasi, ", "ja454:7.4": "candato sasamicchasi”. ", "ja454:8.1": "“Evañce kaṇha jānāsi, ", "ja454:8.2": "yadaññamanusāsasi; ", "ja454:8.3": "Kasmā pure mataṁ puttaṁ, ", "ja454:8.4": "ajjāpi manusocasi”. ", "ja454:9.1": "“Yaṁ na labbhā manussena, ", "ja454:9.2": "amanussena vā puna; ", "ja454:9.3": "Jāto me mā marī putto, ", "ja454:9.4": "kuto labbhā alabbhiyaṁ. ", "ja454:10.1": "Na mantā mūlabhesajjā, ", "ja454:10.2": "osadhehi dhanena vā; ", "ja454:10.3": "Sakkā ānayituṁ kaṇha, ", "ja454:10.4": "yaṁ petamanusocasi”. ", "ja454:11.1": "“Yassa etādisā assu, ", "ja454:11.2": "amaccā purisapaṇḍitā; ", "ja454:11.3": "Yathā nijjhāpaye ajja, ", "ja454:11.4": "ghaṭo purisapaṇḍito. ", "ja454:12.1": "Ādittaṁ vata maṁ santaṁ, ", "ja454:12.2": "ghatasittaṁva pāvakaṁ; ", "ja454:12.3": "Vārinā viya osiñcaṁ, ", "ja454:12.4": "sabbaṁ nibbāpaye daraṁ. ", "ja454:13.1": "Abbahī vata me sallaṁ, ", "ja454:13.2": "yamāsi hadayassitaṁ; ", "ja454:13.3": "Yo me sokaparetassa, ", "ja454:13.4": "puttasokaṁ apānudi. ", "ja454:14.1": "Sohaṁ abbūḷhasallosmi, ", "ja454:14.2": "vītasoko anāvilo; ", "ja454:14.3": "Na socāmi na rodāmi, ", "ja454:14.4": "tava sutvāna māṇava”. ", "ja454:15.1": "“Evaṁ karonti sappaññā, ", "ja454:15.2": "Ye honti anukampakā; ", "ja454:15.3": "Nivattayanti sokamhā, ", "ja454:15.4": "Ghaṭo jeṭṭhaṁva bhātaran”ti. ", "ja454:16.1": "Ghaṭapaṇḍitajātakaṁ soḷasamaṁ. ", "ja454:17.1": "Dasakanipātaṁ niṭṭhitaṁ. ", "ja454:18.1": "Tassuddānaṁ ", "ja454:19.1": "Daḷha kaṇha dhanañjaya saṅkhavaro, ", "ja454:19.2": "Raja sattaha kassa ca takkalinā; ", "ja454:19.3": "Dhammaṁ kukkuṭa kuṇḍali bhojanadā, ", "ja454:19.4": "Cakkavāka subhūrisa sotthi ghaṭoti. "}, "variant_text": {"ja454:0.1": "", "ja454:0.2": "", "ja454:0.3": "", "ja454:0.4": "", "ja454:1.1": "", "ja454:1.2": "", "ja454:1.3": "tuyhaṁ → tāyaṁ (pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja454:1.4": "cakkhu ca → cakkhuñca (bj); cakkhu (sya1ed, sya2ed); cakkhuṁva (pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja454:1.5": "", "ja454:1.6": "Ghaṭo jappati → sasaṁ jappati (?) ", "ja454:2.1": "", "ja454:2.2": "", "ja454:2.3": "", "ja454:2.4": "", "ja454:3.1": "", "ja454:3.2": "", "ja454:3.3": "", "ja454:3.4": "", "ja454:4.1": "", "ja454:4.2": "", "ja454:4.3": "", "ja454:4.4": "", "ja454:5.1": "", "ja454:5.2": "", "ja454:5.3": "", "ja454:5.4": "", "ja454:6.1": "Na cāhamete → na cāhametaṁ (bj); na vāhamete (sya1ed, sya2ed); na vāhametaṁ (pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja454:6.2": "pathavissitā → paṭhaviṁsitā (bj, sya1ed, sya2ed, pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja454:6.3": "", "ja454:6.4": "", "ja454:7.1": "", "ja454:7.2": "", "ja454:7.3": "", "ja454:7.4": "", "ja454:8.1": "", "ja454:8.2": "", "ja454:8.3": "", "ja454:8.4": "", "ja454:9.1": "", "ja454:9.2": "puna → pana (pv18:9 [Kaṇhapetavatthu]) ", "ja454:9.3": "", "ja454:9.4": "", "ja454:10.1": "", "ja454:10.2": "", "ja454:10.3": "", "ja454:10.4": "", "ja454:11.1": "", "ja454:11.2": "", "ja454:11.3": "", "ja454:11.4": "", "ja454:12.1": "", "ja454:12.2": "", "ja454:12.3": "", "ja454:12.4": "", "ja454:13.1": "", "ja454:13.2": "", "ja454:13.3": "", "ja454:13.4": "", "ja454:14.1": "", "ja454:14.2": "", "ja454:14.3": "", "ja454:14.4": "māṇava → bhātika (pv18:18 [Kaṇhapetavatthu]) ", "ja454:15.1": "", "ja454:15.2": "", "ja454:15.3": "", "ja454:15.4": "", "ja454:16.1": "Ghaṭapaṇḍitajātakaṁ → ghatapaṇḍitajātakaṁ (sya1ed, sya2ed); ghatajātakaṁ (pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja454:17.1": "", "ja454:18.1": "", "ja454:19.1": "", "ja454:19.2": "sattaha kassa ca → sattāha sasakha (bj); sattāha sasākha (sya1ed, sya2ed) ", "ja454:19.3": "", "ja454:19.4": ""}, "reference_text": {"ja454:0.1": "", "ja454:0.2": "", "ja454:0.3": "", "ja454:0.4": "", "ja454:1.1": "ms22J_2088, msdiv165, ndp22.216, pts-vp-pli4.84", "ja454:1.2": "", "ja454:1.3": "", "ja454:1.4": "", "ja454:1.5": "", "ja454:1.6": "", "ja454:2.1": "ms22J_2089, msdiv166, pts-vp-pli4.85", "ja454:2.2": "", "ja454:2.3": "", "ja454:2.4": "", "ja454:3.1": "ms22J_2090, msdiv167, sya27.301", "ja454:3.2": "", "ja454:3.3": "", "ja454:3.4": "", "ja454:4.1": "csp1ed22.224, csp2ed22.224, ms22J_2091, msdiv168", "ja454:4.2": "", "ja454:4.3": "", "ja454:4.4": "", "ja454:5.1": "dr27.299, ms22J_2092, msdiv169", "ja454:5.2": "", "ja454:5.3": "", "ja454:5.4": "", "ja454:6.1": "bj30.386, ms22J_2093, msdiv170, vri68.177", "ja454:6.2": "", "ja454:6.3": "", "ja454:6.4": "", "ja454:7.1": "ms22J_2094, msdiv171, pts-vp-pli4.86", "ja454:7.2": "", "ja454:7.3": "", "ja454:7.4": "", "ja454:8.1": "ms22J_2095, msdiv172", "ja454:8.2": "", "ja454:8.3": "", "ja454:8.4": "", "ja454:9.1": "ms22J_2096, msdiv173", "ja454:9.2": "", "ja454:9.3": "", "ja454:9.4": "", "ja454:10.1": "ms22J_2097, msdiv174", "ja454:10.2": "", "ja454:10.3": "", "ja454:10.4": "", "ja454:11.1": "ms22J_2098, msdiv175, pts-vp-pli4.87", "ja454:11.2": "", "ja454:11.3": "", "ja454:11.4": "", "ja454:12.1": "ms22J_2099, msd